Education and car loan debt are huge contributors to the wealth inequality in America.

But when @HouseGOP does nothing to prevent Trump's tariff taxes on automobiles and their parts—and lets Trump saddle thousands of people with higher monthly student loan payments—they're only making the problem worse.

